# No environment variables are required to run or build this site.
#
# Contact forms (homepage hero + /contact/) submit natively to FormSubmit
# (https://formsubmit.co/<email>) — no API key. The destination address is
# BUSINESS.email in src/lib/business.ts. The first-ever submission triggers a
# one-time activation email to that inbox that must be clicked.
#
# (PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY from the earlier Web3Forms setup is no longer used.)
